  On the command shapes: DT_SCHEMA_FILES is intentionally not used.  It is
  passed to dt-validate as "-l", which only keeps schemas whose $id matches
  and that still select a node themselves; snps,dwc3-common.yaml is a
  fragment without "select:", so the run reports nothing and looks green.
  The dtbs_check rule also ends with "|| true", so the result is read from
  the diagnostics in the output, not from the exit status.

